  "facts": [
   {
    "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
    "text": "SNITCHは、男性向けにシャツ、ズボン、ジーンズなどを販売する衣料ブランドである。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.snitch.com/about-us",
    "quote": "offering everything from classic shirts, tailored trousers, and denim",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "FOUNDING",
    "text": "Siddharth R Dungarwalは、小売店向けに衣料を販売するブランドとしてSNITCHを創業した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://yourstory.com/2021/05/b2b-mens-apparel-brand-snitch-d2c-route-covid-pandemic",
    "statedAt": "2019-01",
    "quote": "by Siddharth R Dungarwal",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "FOUNDING",
    "text": "Dungarwalは、他社向けの服づくりを続ける中で、自分の事業を作りたいと考えていた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/article/retail-business/fashion-accessories/snitch-didnt-take-birth-studio-it-happened-scrappy",
    "quote": "I always wanted to create something of my own",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "CHANNEL",
    "text": "SNITCHは、インド各地の小売店に商品を渡して、消費者の反応を確かめるところから始めた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/how-snitch-is-embedding-technology-to-build-a-successful-brand.i1938",
    "quote": "we distributed our stocks initially",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、コロナ禍で小売店向けの販売が落ち込み、売れ残った在庫を抱えた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://yourstory.com/2021/05/b2b-mens-apparel-brand-snitch-d2c-route-covid-pandemic",
    "quote": "stuck with a huge inventory",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "Dungarwalは、通販サイトFlipkartやMyntraで在庫を売る方法では利益を得られないと考えた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/how-snitch-is-embedding-technology-to-build-a-successful-brand.i1938",
    "quote": "we wouldn’t be making any money",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "CHANNEL",
    "text": "SNITCHは、販売開始当初の商品宣伝にSNSを使った。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/how-snitch-is-embedding-technology-to-build-a-successful-brand.i1938",
    "quote": "social media was the only platform",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、顧客の信頼を得るため、通常の営業時間外にも問い合わせに答えた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/how-snitch-is-embedding-technology-to-build-a-successful-brand.i1938",
    "quote": "even at odd hours",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "FUNDING",
    "text": "Dungarwalは、家族の支援を受けてSNITCHの初期資金を用意した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://yourstory.com/2021/05/b2b-mens-apparel-brand-snitch-d2c-route-covid-pandemic",
    "quote": "with backing from his family",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "OTHER",
    "text": "創業者によると、SNITCHの月間売上は約4 croreインドルピーに達した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://yourstory.com/2021/05/b2b-mens-apparel-brand-snitch-d2c-route-covid-pandemic",
    "quote": "around Rs 4 crore",
    "numberKind": "REVENUE",
    "asOf": "2021-03",
    "periodKind": "MONTH",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、他社の通販サイトで売るより先に、自社の通販サイトを作った。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/here-s-how-snitch-giving-high-fashion-goals-to-indian-men.i1923",
    "quote": "the brand created its website",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、顧客が返品や交換を申し込む手続きを自動化した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/here-s-how-snitch-giving-high-fashion-goals-to-indian-men.i1923",
    "quote": "returns and exchange process seamless through automation",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "CHANNEL",
    "text": "SNITCHは、自社の買い物用アプリを公開した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/startup/here-s-how-snitch-giving-high-fashion-goals-to-indian-men.i1923",
    "quote": "it has launched an app",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "CHANNEL",
    "text": "Dungarwalによると、起業家が出資を募るテレビ番組Shark Tank Indiaへの出演後に、SNITCHのサイトを訪れる人が増えた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/television/shark-tank-india-2-snitch-founder-siddharth-dungarwal-on-bagging-an-all-shark-deal-busts-myth-about-show/",
    "quote": "post the episode, his website saw massive traffic",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "FUNDING",
    "text": "SNITCHは、シリーズAと呼ばれる資金調達で110 croreインドルピーを集めた。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/new-commerce/how-tech-infused-threads-define-snitchs-journey-prominence",
    "quote": "raised Rs 110 Cr",
    "numberKind": "FUNDING",
    "asOf": "2023-12",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "Dungarwalによると、実店舗での販売を始めた後、顧客の購入額の平均が上がった。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/new-commerce/how-tech-infused-threads-define-snitchs-journey-prominence",
    "quote": "boost in average order value",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "Dungarwalによると、実店舗での販売を始めた後、返品が減った。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/interview/retail-people/new-commerce/how-tech-infused-threads-define-snitchs-journey-prominence",
    "quote": "reduced returns when we ventured into retail",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "Dungarwalは、最初の店舗で採算が合ったため、出店を増やしたと説明した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/article/retail-business/fashion-accessories/snitch-didnt-take-birth-studio-it-happened-scrappy",
    "quote": "The unit economics made sense.",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "CHANNEL",
    "text": "SNITCHは、通販で売れ行きのよい地域への出店を優先した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.indianretailer.com/article/retail-business/fashion-accessories/snitch-didnt-take-birth-studio-it-happened-scrappy",
    "quote": "our top-performing regions first",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "FUNDING",
    "text": "SNITCHは、新株発行によって会社に入る資金として約280 croreインドルピーを調達した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/startup/snitch-secures-rs-340-crore-from-360-one-asset-manyavar-s-ravi-modi-others-13083779.html",
    "quote": "raised about Rs 280 crore in primary capital",
    "numberKind": "FUNDING",
    "asOf": "2025",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、注文した衣服を短時間で届けるサービスSnitch Quickを開始した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://textileinsights.in/snitch-revenue-jumps-80-to-rs-900-cr-in-fy26/",
    "statedAt": "2025-10",
    "quote": "Snitch Quick launched in October 2025",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、衣料品に加えて香水、靴、アクセサリーにも商品を広げている。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://textileinsights.in/snitch-revenue-jumps-80-to-rs-900-cr-in-fy26/",
    "quote": "expanding beyond core apparel into lifestyle segments including perfumes, footwear and accessories",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
    "kind": "EVENT",
    "text": "SNITCHは、米国、イスラエル、イランを巡る緊張を理由に、西アジアへの店舗展開を一時停止した。",
    "sourceUrl": "https://textileinsights.in/snitch-revenue-jumps-80-to-rs-900-cr-in-fy26/",
    "quote": "temporarily paused its international retail expansion plans in West Asia",
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-08"
   },
   {
